mes immune to crowd control and ghosted and, after a brief delay, charges forward in the direction of the cursor for up to 8 seconds, during which he is able to steer at a slow turn rate while automatically navigating his movement. Unstoppable Onslaught can be recast after 0.4 seconds during the channel.","The charge ramps up Sion's movement speed at the time of cast by 40 movement speed every 0.1 seconds, up to 950 total movement speed.","At the end of the charge's duration, Sion leaps forward 300 units, landing after 0.55 seconds and slamming the ground beneath him. Sion will stop upon colliding with an enemy champion or terrain during the charge, ending Unstoppable Onslaught with a slam. Crashing into terrain stuns Sion for 0.5 seconds.","Recast: Sion stops charging, causing him to leap forward and slam the ground beneath him as if Unstoppable Onslaught had reached the end of its duration."]}]}],"formulaVersion":"15.15.1","history":[{"patch":"26.21","date":"2026-10-20","articleDate":"2026-10-20","url":"https://www.leagueoflegends.com/ko-kr/news/game-updates/league-of-legends-patch-26-21-notes/#patch-sion","changes":[{"slot":"S","title":"기본 능력치","text":"체력 : 655 + 레벨당 87 ⇒ 655 + 레벨당 95","kind":"buff"},{"slot":"R","title":"R - 멈출 수 없는 맹공","text":"정신 집중 시작 후 첫 3초 동안 피해량 증가 : +기본 피해량의 0~166.67%, 피해 계수의 0~100% ⇒ +0~200%","kind":"adjust"},{"slot":"R","title":"R - 멈출 수 없는 맹공","text":"버그 수정 : 이제 툴팁에 최소 및 최대 추가 공격력 계수(40~120%)가 정상적으로 표시됩니다. 기존에는 추가 공격력 계수(60%~120%)가 잘못 표시되었습니다. 25.16 패치에서 툴팁만 수정되었을 뿐, 실제 수치는 변경되지 않았습니다.","kind":"fix"}],"section":"챔피언","isHotfix":false},{"patch":"26.13","date":"2026-06-23","articleDate":"2026-06-23","url":"https://www.leagueoflegends.com/ko-kr/news/game-updates/league-of-legends-patch-26-13-notes/#patch-sion","changes":[{"slot":"Q","title":"Q - 대량 학살 강타","text":"최소 피해량 : 40/60/80/100/120 ⇒ 30/45/60/75/90","kind":"nerf"},{"slot":"W","title":"W - 영혼의 용광로","text":"마나 소모량 : 65/70/75/80/85 ⇒ 75/80/85/90/95","kind":"nerf"}],"section":"챔피언","isHo